OL,3,GNEWSADriver not guilty of causing man's
OL,4,Acar fall death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver accused of accelerating before
OL,7,Fbraking sharply while a man was on the
OL,8,Fbonnet of his car has been found not
OL,9,Fguilty of causing his death by
OL,10,Fdangerous driving.
OL,12,FJordan Thomas, 29, fell from the front
OL,13,Fof Jackson Paul's car in Onchan on 25
OL,14,FFebruary 2024.
OL,16,FThe trial heard Paul, 37, had been
OL,17,Fdriving on Harbour Road when Thomas got
OL,18,Fonto the bonnet of his BMW and started
OL,19,Fpulling at the windscreen wipers and
OL,20,Fpunching the windscreen.
